---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: How the model test of switching works
    accDescr: fast-check makes up an evening of up to 60 steps: actions of the extension and events in the page, at Autodarts and on the network, in any order. They run against a fake page whose requests can fail, a storage that keeps JSON and a fake Autodarts that rotates every refresh token. After every step the test checks its rules; when one breaks, fast-check shrinks the evening to the shortest one that breaks it and prints it with its seed.

    evening["fast-check makes up an evening<br>of up to 60 steps"]
    subgraph steps ["Each step, in any order"]
        direction TB
        extension["The extension<br>a tap on an account, Add account,<br>adopt, sync, the background refresh,<br>a password kept, wrong or dropped"]
        world["Around it<br>the page signs in, renews and signs out,<br>Autodarts ends sessions, changes a password<br>or can't be reached"]
    end
    fakes["The fakes<br>an Autodarts page whose requests can fail,<br>a storage that keeps JSON,<br>an Autodarts that rotates every refresh token"]
    rules["The rules after every step<br>no account loses a session it could still use,<br>only adopting renews the page's token,<br>no session is kept twice or under another account"]
    shrunk["fast-check shrinks the evening<br>to the shortest one that breaks the rule<br>and prints it with the seed to run it again"]

    evening --> steps --> fakes --> rules
    rules -- "a rule breaks" --> shrunk

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef failed fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class evening,fakes bot
    class extension,world person
    class rules done
    class shrunk failed
